                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A fine logic puzzler with a rather reasonable price tag. The main gist of the game is to solve each problem as optimally as possible and see where you rank in the leaderboards in 3 different categories: objects used, overall beam length and the always important logic tics that it took to arrive to said solution.\n\nRather nice that the game allows you to save different solutions to the same puzzle and you can redo/undo all you want. \n\nIf this seems enjoyable to you than rest assured, it will be enjoyable. If not, then scamper off to play some other game more suited to your tastes. All good either way.",
